This project uses separately distributed open-source dependencies, including
Loudkit, Parakeet MLX, FastAPI, and the MCP Python SDK. Those projects and the
downloaded speech model weights retain their own licenses and notices.
Model weights, user recordings, credentials, and third-party agent code are not
included in this repository.

Default speech models (downloaded separately):

- LoudReader Loudr-1 Turbo: https://huggingface.co/loudreader/loudr-1-turbo
  Apache-2.0.
- Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, MLX conversion by mlx-community:
  https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  CC-BY-4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Based on NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3:
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  Consult the model cards for authorship, conversion details, and model terms.

